# One byte sequence, every platform. This repository is built on digests of
# file content and on tests that parse its own text, and Windows checks out
# CRLF by default — which has now broken two gates in two different ways: the
# projection-shape stamp hashed different bytes there, and the skill's front
# matter stopped matching `^---\n`. Normalising the checkout removes the class
# rather than the two instances.
* text=auto eol=lf
